    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 29EA ",
            "block_bbox": [
                148,
                87,
                322,
                109
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) a registrable superannuation entity specified in the condition;or \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                314,
                157,
                1003,
                205
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) a registrable superannuation entity included in the class of registrable superannuation entities specified in the condition.",
            "block_bbox": [
                315,
                218,
                1002,
                272
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Without limiting subsection (1), an additional condition imposed under that subsection on an RSE licence may provide that the RSE.licensee must ensure that a fund specified in the condition, or in a class of funds specified in the condition, must comply with the alternative agreed representation rules whenever section 92 applies to the fund. However, before imposing such a condition, APRA must have regard to any written guidelines determined by APRA under this subsection.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                256,
                294,
                1013,
                516
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) If the RSE licensee is also a financial services licensee:",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                542,
                893,
                565
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) APRA must consult ASIC before imposing a condition that,in APRA's opinion, might reasonably be expected to affect the RSE licensee's ability to provide one or more of the financial services (within the meaning of the Corporations Act 2001) that the RSE licensee provides; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                313,
                574,
                1008,
                713
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) APRA must inform ASIC about the imposition of any condition not covered by paragraph (a) within one week after the condition is imposed.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                313,
                724,
                1026,
                805
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) A failure to comply with a requirement of subsection (5) does not invalidate the imposition of any condition..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                252,
                830,
                1014,
                884
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(7) An additional condition imposed under this section comes into force on the later of:",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                906,
                984,
                958
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) the day on which APRA gives the RSE licensee the notice of.the condition; or \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                966,
                1033,
                1018
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) the day specified in the notice as the day on which the condition comes into force.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                1027,
                957,
                1080
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "82",
            "block_bbox": [
                171,
                1311,
                192,
                1327
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
